<title>FRANCE: Moulinex capital increase fully subscribed.</title>
<headline>Moulinex capital increase fully subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French appliances maker Moulinex said on Thursday its capital increase for 525 million francs which closed on February 10 was fully subscribed.</p>
</text>
